        "The union mask on Crop For Inpaint sets CONTEXT only. Keep its blend/grow/blur at 0. Final paste uses the separate strict alpha from Prepare Masks.\n\nDenoise 1.0 is intentional: the native encoder provides an empty matching latent. Lowering it is not a preservation slider.\n\nStart with 2 MP. Try 4 MP only as a comparison; never resize the whole scene or globally upscale the final when pixel preservation matters.\n\nLeave optional refs at __none__. If a garment photo is supplied it controls the outfit; otherwise edit garment_description. The actual compiled prompt and reference roles are saved in the audit JSON."
      ]
    }
